[Nemo Action]
Name=Add to Proton-Autogen
Name[fr]=Ajouter à Proton-Autogen
Comment=Register this program in Proton-Autogen and open the UX
Comment[fr]=Enregistrer ce programme dans Proton-Autogen et ouvrir l'UX
Exec=proton-autogen addux %F
Icon-Name=proton-autogen
Selection=s
Extensions=exe;msi;bat;lnk;
Quote=double
